    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PhCH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><munderover><mo>→</mo><mrow><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi>CrO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>/</mo><msub><mi>CCl</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>PhCH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>CHO</mi></math><br />\r<br />\rThe above reaction is an example of which name reaction?"
